mtSuA" contextRef="Duration_12_15_2023_To_12_15_2023_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_IPOMember_gr7mUX4vw0O96QI7v1upqg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_BeTN1iuwE0mK8Ki198VTWA">140,000,000</ix:nonFraction> Class A Ordinary Shares, were issued and sold to the public at a price of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_CNQ7_euPaESCWfLCOg_SEQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_15_2023_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_IPOMember_jzW_xI7DeEqbcszLL9ciaw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_s9uRjUVpfEWSPy3FxsTnrA">15.50</ix:nonFraction> per ADS. Immediately prior to the completion of the IPO, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_WWa0mr-4EkisOeXkjmtSuA" contextRef="Duration_12_15_2023_To_12_15_2023_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_zkh_ConvertibleRedeemablePreferredSharesOtherThanSeriesFMember_Nw3lI2cPLUCxbWmhodNiVA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ConversionOfStockSharesConverted1" scale="0" id="Narr_zOhieW7LPkWsrAeCPIoXlw">3,746,626,700</ix:nonFraction> of convertible redeemable preferred shares were automatically converted into Class A Ordinary Shares on a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_Q6tcltme0karclZNQo6DhQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_15_2023_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_zkh_ConvertibleRedeemablePreferredSharesOtherThanSeriesFMember_LU2IcPYkpUW3KO9JfXNAaA" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockConvertibleConversionRatio" scale="0" id="Narr_mIPNd_RqjESYWM1grtLemQ">one</ix:nonFraction>-for-one basis, and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_WWa0mr-4EkisOeXkjmtSuA" contextRef="Duration_12_15_2023_To_12_15_2023_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_zkh_SeriesFConvertibleRedeemablePreferredSharesMember_kAvOdJBUPUOrzCKndpN3